{"id":"memphis-pop","title":"Memphis Pop — Festival Poster","description":"The 1980s Memphis group reborn as a festival page — zigzags, dots, squiggles and geometric shapes in bright primaries over white, with bold outlined type and a live countdown. Perfect for events and poster-style pages.","tags":["memphis","festival","poster"],"type":"code","link":null,"updated":"2026-10-11T19:01:41.488Z","docs":{"file":"design.md","raw":"---\ntitle: Memphis Pop — Festival Poster\ndescription: The 1980s Memphis group reborn as a festival page — zigzags, dots, squiggles and geometric shapes in bright primaries over white, with bold outlined type and a live countdown. Perfect for events and poster-style pages.\ntags: [memphis, festival, poster]\norder: 18\n---\n\n# Memphis Pop — Festival Poster\n\nThe Memphis Milano look: white space invaded by confetti geometry — zigzag ribbons,\ndot grids, triangles, half-circles and squiggles — all in bright primaries with chunky\nblack outlines, wrapped around a festival poster.\n\n## Tokens\n\n| Token | Value |\n|---|---|\n| Paper | `#ffffff` with scattered shapes |\n| Primaries | red `#ff5252` · amber `#ffd740` · blue `#40c4ff` · green `#69f0ae` · pink `#ff4081` |\n| Outline | 3px solid `#111` on shapes and cards |\n| Type | system sans, 900-weight outlined display |\n\n## Pieces\n\nPoster header with outlined title → info chips → **live countdown** to the event\n(days/hours/minutes/seconds, ticking every second) → lineup list with hover wiggle →\nthree ticket tiers → patterned footer.\n\n## Files\n\n- `index.html` — self-contained, no dependencies, works offline.\n","body":"\n# Memphis Pop — Festival Poster\n\nThe Memphis Milano look: white space invaded by confetti geometry — zigzag ribbons,\ndot grids, triangles, half-circles and squiggles — all in bright primaries with chunky\nblack outlines, wrapped around a festival poster.\n\n## Tokens\n\n| Token | Value |\n|---|---|\n| Paper | `#ffffff` with scattered shapes |\n| Primaries | red `#ff5252` · amber `#ffd740` · blue `#40c4ff` · green `#69f0ae` · pink `#ff4081` |\n| Outline | 3px solid `#111` on shapes and cards |\n| Type | system sans, 900-weight outlined display |\n\n## Pieces\n\nPoster header with outlined title → info chips → **live countdown** to the event\n(days/hours/minutes/seconds, ticking every second) → lineup list with hover wiggle →\nthree ticket tiers → patterned footer.\n\n## Files\n\n- `index.html` — self-contained, no dependencies, works offline.\n"},"files":[{"path":"index.html","lang":"html","content":"\u003c!DOCTYPE html>\n\u003chtml lang=\"en\">\n\u003chead>\n\u003cmeta charset=\"UTF-8\">\n\u003cmeta name=\"viewport\" content=\"width=device-width, initial-scale=1.0\">\n\u003ctitle>POP FEST '26 — Memphis Poster\u003c/title>\n\u003cstyle>\n  * { box-sizing: border-box; margin: 0; padding: 0; }\n  body { font-family: \"Segoe UI\", system-ui, sans-serif; background: #fff; color: #111; overflow-x: hidden; }\n  .wrap { max-width: 920px; margin: 0 auto; padding: 30px 22px 60px; position: relative; }\n\n  /* scattered memphis shapes */\n  .deco { position: absolute; pointer-events: none; }\n  .dots { width: 120px; height: 70px; top: 20px; right: 30px; background: radial-gradient(#111 2.4px, transparent 2.6px); background-size: 18px 18px; opacity: 0.85; }\n  .dots2 { width: 100px; height: 60px; bottom: 40px; left: 24px; background: radial-gradient(#ff5252 2.4px, transparent 2.6px); background-size: 16px 16px; }\n  .zig { width: 150px; height: 26px; top: 120px; left: 40px; background: repeating-linear-gradient(135deg, #40c4ff 0 10px, transparent 10px 20px); transform: rotate(-6deg); }\n  .squig { width: 120px; height: 40px; bottom: 120px; right: 40px; border: 4px solid #ff4081; border-radius: 50%; border-top-color: transparent; border-left-color: transparent; transform: rotate(24deg); }\n  .tri { width: 0; height: 0; border-left: 26px solid transparent; border-right: 26px solid transparent; border-bottom: 44px solid #ffd740; top: 90px; right: 200px; transform: rotate(14deg); }\n  .half { width: 56px; height: 28px; background: #69f0ae; border: 3px solid #111; border-bottom: 0; border-radius: 56px 56px 0 0; bottom: 200px; right: 120px; transform: rotate(-10deg); }\n  .circle { width: 34px; height: 34px; border: 4px solid #ff5252; border-radius: 50%; top: 260px; left: 20px; }\n\n  .top { text-align: center; padding-top: 20px; }\n  .kick { display: inline-block; background: #ffd740; border: 3px solid #111; font-weight: 800; font-size: 12px; letter-spacing: 0.24em; padding: 6px 16px; transform: rotate(-2deg); }\n  h1 { font-size: clamp(52px, 10vw, 110px); font-weight: 900; letter-spacing: -0.02em; line-height: 0.95; margin: 20px 0 6px;\n    -webkit-text-stroke: 2.5px #111; color: #fff; text-shadow: 6px 6px 0 #40c4ff, 12px 12px 0 #ff4081; }\n  .year { font-size: clamp(26px, 4.5vw, 40px); font-weight: 900; letter-spacing: 0.3em; color: #ff5252; }\n  .info { display: flex; justify-content: center; gap: 12px; flex-wrap: wrap; margin: 24px 0 8px; }\n  .chip { border: 3px solid #111; border-radius: 999px; padding: 7px 18px; font-weight: 700; font-size: 12.5px; background: #fff; }\n  .chip.r { background: #ff5252; color: #fff; } .chip.b { background: #40c4ff; } .chip.g { background: #69f0ae; }\n\n  /* countdown */\n  .count { display: flex; justify-content: center; gap: 14px; margin: 34px 0 10px; }\n  .cu { border: 3px solid #111; border-radius: 14px; padding: 14px 10px; min-width: 86px; text-align: center; box-shadow: 5px 5px 0 #111; }\n  .cu:nth-child(1) { background: #ffd740; } .cu:nth-child(2) { background: #40c4ff; }\n  .cu:nth-child(3) { background: #ff4081; color: #fff; } .cu:nth-child(4) { background: #69f0ae; }\n  .cu .n { font-size: 34px; font-weight: 900; line-height: 1; font-variant-numeric: tabular-nums; }\n  .cu .l { font-size: 10.5px; font-weight: 800; letter-spacing: 0.16em; margin-top: 4px; }\n\n  .lineup { margin: 44px auto 8px; max-width: 620px; }\n  .lineup h2 { text-align: center; font-size: 15px; letter-spacing: 0.3em; font-weight: 900; margin-bottom: 16px; }\n  .act { display: flex; justify-content: space-between; align-items: center; gap: 10px; border: 3px solid #111; border-radius: 12px; padding: 12px 16px; margin-bottom: 10px; font-weight: 800; font-size: 15px; background: #fff; transition: transform 0.15s; cursor: default; }\n  .act:hover { transform: translate(-3px, -3px) rotate(-0.6deg); box-shadow: 5px 5px 0 #111; }\n  .act:nth-child(1) { background: #ff5252; color: #fff; } .act:nth-child(2) { background: #40c4ff; }\n  .act:nth-child(3) { background: #ffd740; } .act:nth-child(4) { background: #69f0ae; } .act:nth-child(5) { background: #ff4081; color: #fff; }\n  .act .tm { font-size: 12px; font-weight: 700; }\n\n  .tickets { display: grid; grid-template-columns: repeat(3, 1fr); gap: 16px; margin-top: 40px; }\n  .tk { border: 3px solid #111; border-radius: 14px; padding: 20px 18px; text-align: center; box-shadow: 6px 6px 0 #111; background: #fff; }\n  .tk.hot { background: #ffd740; transform: rotate(-1.5deg); }\n  .tk .tier { font-size: 11px; font-weight: 900; letter-spacing: 0.2em; }\n  .tk .price { font-size: 32px; font-weight: 900; margin: 6px 0 2px; }\n  .tk .per { font-size: 11px; color: #444; }\n  .tk ul { list-style: none; margin: 12px 0 14px; font-size: 12px; font-weight: 600; }\n  .tk li { padding: 3px 0; }\n  .tk li::before { content: \"★ \"; }\n  .tk button { border: 3px solid #111; background: #111; color: #fff; font: inherit; font-weight: 800; font-size: 12px; padding: 8px 18px; border-radius: 8px; cursor: pointer; }\n  .tk button:hover { background: #ff5252; }\n  .tk .soldout { color: #c62828; font-weight: 900; font-size: 12px; letter-spacing: 0.14em; }\n\n  footer { text-align: center; padding-top: 40px; font-weight: 800; font-size: 12px; letter-spacing: 0.18em; }\n  .zig-f { height: 16px; max-width: 920px; margin: 0 auto 12px; background: repeating-linear-gradient(135deg, #ff5252 0 12px, #40c4ff 12px 24px, #ffd740 24px 36px, #69f0ae 36px 48px); border-top: 3px solid #111; border-bottom: 3px solid #111; }\n\n  @media (max-width: 700px) { .tickets { grid-template-columns: 1fr; } .deco { display: none; } }\n\u003c/style>\n\u003c/head>\n\u003cbody>\n  \u003cdiv class=\"wrap\">\n    \u003cdiv class=\"deco dots\">\u003c/div>\u003cdiv class=\"deco dots2\">\u003c/div>\u003cdiv class=\"deco zig\">\u003c/div>\n    \u003cdiv class=\"deco squig\">\u003c/div>\u003cdiv class=\"deco tri\">\u003c/div>\u003cdiv class=\"deco half\">\u003c/div>\u003cdiv class=\"deco circle\">\u003c/div>\n\n    \u003cdiv class=\"top\">\n      \u003cspan class=\"kick\">ONE WEEKEND · 12 STAGES · ZERO BORING BITS\u003c/span>\n      \u003ch1>POP FEST\u003c/h1>\n      \u003cdiv class=\"year\">'26 EDITION\u003c/div>\n      \u003cdiv class=\"info\">\n        \u003cspan class=\"chip r\">📅 31 DEC 2026\u003c/span>\n        \u003cspan class=\"chip b\">📍 Stadium Merdeka, KL\u003c/span>\n        \u003cspan class=\"chip g\">🎶 40+ artists\u003c/span>\n      \u003c/div>\n\n      \u003cdiv class=\"count\" id=\"count\">\n        \u003cdiv class=\"cu\">\u003cdiv class=\"n\" id=\"d\">00\u003c/div>\u003cdiv class=\"l\">DAYS\u003c/div>\u003c/div>\n        \u003cdiv class=\"cu\">\u003cdiv class=\"n\" id=\"h\">00\u003c/div>\u003cdiv class=\"l\">HOURS\u003c/div>\u003c/div>\n        \u003cdiv class=\"cu\">\u003cdiv class=\"n\" id=\"m\">00\u003c/div>\u003cdiv class=\"l\">MINS\u003c/div>\u003c/div>\n        \u003cdiv class=\"cu\">\u003cdiv class=\"n\" id=\"s\">00\u003c/div>\u003cdiv class=\"l\">SECS\u003c/div>\u003c/div>\n      \u003c/div>\n    \u003c/div>\n\n    \u003cdiv class=\"lineup\">\n      \u003ch2>★ THE LINEUP ★\u003c/h2>\n      \u003cdiv class=\"act\">\u003cspan>THE PAPER PLANES\u003c/span>\u003cspan class=\"tm\">9:00 PM · Main\u003c/span>\u003c/div>\n      \u003cdiv class=\"act\">\u003cspan>KRUNCH KOLLEKTIVE\u003c/span>\u003cspan class=\"tm\">8:00 PM · East\u003c/span>\u003c/div>\n      \u003cdiv class=\"act\">\u003cspan>MATA HARI & THE MOON\u003c/span>\u003cspan class=\"tm\">7:00 PM · West\u003c/span>\u003c/div>\n      \u003cdiv class=\"act\">\u003cspan>DJ GULA MELAKA\u003c/span>\u003cspan class=\"tm\">6:00 PM · Tent\u003c/span>\u003c/div>\n      \u003cdiv class=\"act\">\u003cspan>PERCUSSION PANAS\u003c/span>\u003cspan class=\"tm\">5:00 PM · Acoustic\u003c/span>\u003c/div>\n    \u003c/div>\n\n    \u003cdiv class=\"tickets\">\n      \u003cdiv class=\"tk\">\n        \u003cdiv class=\"tier\">DAY PASS\u003c/div>\n        \u003cdiv class=\"price\">RM 149\u003c/div>\u003cdiv class=\"per\">1 day · 1 stage\u003c/div>\n        \u003cul>\u003cli>Main stage access\u003c/li>\u003cli>Food village\u003c/li>\u003c/ul>\n        \u003cbutton>Buy now\u003c/button>\n      \u003c/div>\n      \u003cdiv class=\"tk hot\">\n        \u003cdiv class=\"tier\">FULL WEEKEND ⭐\u003c/div>\n        \u003cdiv class=\"price\">RM 299\u003c/div>\u003cdiv class=\"per\">3 days · all stages\u003c/div>\n        \u003cul>\u003cli>All stages + aftershow\u003c/li>\u003cli>Fast lane entry\u003c/li>\u003cli>Limited edition tee\u003c/li>\u003c/ul>\n        \u003cbutton>Buy now\u003c/button>\n      \u003c/div>\n      \u003cdiv class=\"tk\">\n        \u003cdiv class=\"tier\">VIP BACKSTAGE\u003c/div>\n        \u003cdiv class=\"price\">RM 599\u003c/div>\u003cdiv class=\"per\">everything + more\u003c/div>\n        \u003cul>\u003cli>Backstage tour\u003c/li>\u003cli>Artist meet & greet\u003c/li>\u003c/ul>\n        \u003cbutton>Sold out\u003c/button>\u003cdiv class=\"soldout\" hidden>SOLD OUT\u003c/div>\n      \u003c/div>\n    \u003c/div>\n\n    \u003cfooter>\u003cdiv class=\"zig-f\">\u003c/div>POP FEST '26 · BRING EARPLUGS, LEAVE WITH MEMORIES\u003c/footer>\n  \u003c/div>\n\n  \u003cscript>\n    // live countdown to the festival\n    const target = new Date('2026-12-31T17:00:00+08:00').getTime();\n    const $ = id => document.getElementById(id);\n    function tick() {\n      let diff = Math.max(0, target - Date.now());\n      const d = Math.floor(diff / 864e5); diff -= d * 864e5;\n      const h = Math.floor(diff / 36e5); diff -= h * 36e5;\n      const m = Math.floor(diff / 6e4); diff -= m * 6e4;\n      const s = Math.floor(diff / 1e3);\n      $('d').textContent = String(d).padStart(2, '0');\n      $('h').textContent = String(h).padStart(2, '0');\n      $('m').textContent = String(m).padStart(2, '0');\n      $('s').textContent = String(s).padStart(2, '0');\n    }\n    tick();\n    setInterval(tick, 1000);\n  \u003c/script>\n\u003c/body>\n\u003c/html>\n"}],"preview":{"file":"index.html","html":"\u003c!DOCTYPE html>\n\u003chtml lang=\"en\">\n\u003chead>\u003cscript>(function(){try{window.localStorage.getItem(\"__probe__\")}catch(e){var s={};var o={getItem:function(k){return k in s?s[k]:null},setItem:function(k,v){s[k]=String(v)},removeItem:function(k){delete s[k]},clear:function(){s={}},key:function(i){return Object.keys(s)[i]||null}};Object.defineProperty(o,\"length\",{get:function(){return Object.keys(s).length},configurable:true});try{Object.defineProperty(window,\"localStorage\",{value:o,configurable:true})}catch(e2){}}})();\u003c/script>\n\u003cmeta charset=\"UTF-8\">\n\u003cmeta name=\"viewport\" content=\"width=device-width, initial-scale=1.0\">\n\u003ctitle>POP FEST '26 — Memphis Poster\u003c/title>\n\u003cstyle>\n  * { box-sizing: border-box; margin: 0; padding: 0; }\n  body { font-family: \"Segoe UI\", system-ui, sans-serif; background: #fff; color: #111; overflow-x: hidden; }\n  .wrap { max-width: 920px; margin: 0 auto; padding: 30px 22px 60px; position: relative; }\n\n  /* scattered memphis shapes */\n  .deco { position: absolute; pointer-events: none; }\n  .dots { width: 120px; height: 70px; top: 20px; right: 30px; background: radial-gradient(#111 2.4px, transparent 2.6px); background-size: 18px 18px; opacity: 0.85; }\n  .dots2 { width: 100px; height: 60px; bottom: 40px; left: 24px; background: radial-gradient(#ff5252 2.4px, transparent 2.6px); background-size: 16px 16px; }\n  .zig { width: 150px; heigh